<title>USA: Everest instruments approved in Japan.</title>
<headline>Everest instruments approved in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everest Medical Corp said its laparoscopy products received regulatory approval for sale in Japan.</p>
<p>Everest said it named Amco Inc as Japanese distributor.</p>
<p>Product introduction is expected to begin late in the second quarter, Everest said.</p>
<p>Everest makes bipolar electrosurgery instrumentation for minimally invasive surgery.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
